WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:00.850
[Warm piano and orchestral music]

00:00.850 --> 00:02.318
Coming this fall.

00:04.400 --> 00:06.796
He knows how good they've been.

00:08.400 --> 00:10.542
He knows their wish list.

00:14.250 --> 00:16.160
He knows their name.

00:19.200 --> 00:22.236
Experience Santa in a whole new way.

00:23.000 --> 00:26.000
[A soft chime. Sleigh bells.]
